From: Ze kernel maintainers
Subject: [PATCH 13B] ipv6: constrain PPP control receive selection and delivery

PRIVATE SOURCE ONLY. Pinned Linux v7.3 + frozen 0012/0012a/0013a.
No constructor dispatch, capability bit 9, Go change, build or native proof.
Requires coordinated 13C IPv6-only/option/sockmap restrictions and actual
PMTU/redirect route-writer guards before activation. Unowned sockets retain
native selection, checksum, extension, copy, error and PMTU behavior.

